      "principle": "The onus of proving the factum of adoption is on the party relying on it.",
      "held": "Their Lordships' Board think it would be impossible to rely on this piece of evidence and this piece of evidence alone for the purpose of satisfying the very grave and serious onus that rests upon any person who seeks to displace the natural succession of property by the act of an adoption.",
